//  KnownApps.swift
//  3105 adaptation (worse_query)
//
//  Built-in bundle-ID -> display-name table. Friendly names cannot be
//  read from bundle containers in this sandbox (MCM class-1 lookups
//  return nothing for third-party apps, the bundle tree cannot be
//  enumerated, LaunchServices is empty), so common apps are named from
//  this table instead. The table doubles as the dictionary for the
//  container-identity probing pass in ContainerStore: apps that keep
//  their preferences in an App Group suite leave no local identity
//  candidates, and containermanagerd is asked for their path by ID.
//

